OL,3,GNEWSAPolice live facial recognition
OL,4,Aplans 'postponed'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm very pleased that Avon and
OL,7,FSomerset Police has responded so
OL,8,Fpromptly and understood what our
OL,9,Fconcerns are, which is very much about
OL,10,Frestrictions of freedoms to our
OL,11,Fcitizens," she said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
